    "iconBanner": null,
    "chapters": [
      {
        "id": 17161,
        "title": "Booleanos",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145202,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Há um valor especial que <em>não é</em> uma string <em>nem</em> um número: <code>true</code>.</p><p>Não há aspas em torno dele, e não é um valor numérico.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145203,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>true</code> é ótimo para situações como verificar se uma configuração de jogo está habilitada.</p><p>Exiba <code>true</code> no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"46\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Sound enabled&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145204,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos armazenar <code>true</code> em uma variável assim como uma string ou um número.</p><p>Armazene <code>true</code> em uma variável e exiba no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"20\" endIndex=\"24\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"49\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" gameRunning = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(gameRunning);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code> seguido de <code>gameRunning</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145205,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p><code>false</code> é outro valor especial e o oposto de <code>true</code>. Podemos usá-lo como <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145206,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Salve o valor <code>false</code> na variável <code>status</code> e exiba <code>status</code> no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"var\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"44\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"63\" endIndex=\"69\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Player alive&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" status = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(status);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code> seguido de <code>status</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145207,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual é um bom uso para os valores <code>true</code> e <code>false</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Mostrando se uma configuração do jogo está ativada ou desativada</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Armazenando valores de um a cinco</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Mostrando se uma configuração do jogo está ativada ou desativada.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145208,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que <code>false</code> não é uma string?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoPlay = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Não há aspas ao redor disso</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Está armazenado dentro de uma variável</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Não há aspas ao redor disso.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145209,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Escolha a melhor opção para mostrar que um jogador não tem mais vidas.</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>const hasLives = false;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>const hasLives = true;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>const hasLives = false;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145210,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que <code>\"false\"</code> não é o mesmo que <code>false</code>?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Há aspas ao redor, então <code>\"false\"</code> é uma string</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>\"false\"</code> e <code>false</code> são iguais</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Há aspas ao redor, então <code>\"false\"</code> é uma string.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145211,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Mostre o status da configuração de reprodução automática exibindo <code>false</code> no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"33\" /><option startIndex=\"33\" endIndex=\"34\" /><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"37\" /><option startIndex=\"37\" endIndex=\"38\" /><option startIndex=\"38\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"43\" endIndex=\"44\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"&quot;Auto-play&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\");\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>console</code> seguido de <code>.</code> e depois <code>log</code>, <code>(</code>, <code>false</code>, <code>)</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145212,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie a variável <code>autoSaveGame</code> e armazene <code>true</code> dentro dela.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"0\" endIndex=\"5\" /><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"25\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoSaveGame = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>autoSaveGame</code> e finalmente <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145213,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Desative o fogo amigo criando a variável e armazenando <code>false</code> nela.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;false&quot;\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"6\" endIndex=\"18\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"26\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" friendlyFire = \" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>friendlyFire</code> seguido de <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145214,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Ajuste as configurações de reprodução automática codificando <code>true</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"17\" endIndex=\"21\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" autoPlay = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": 17162,
        "title": "Negando Valores",
        "type": "practiceLevel1",
        "lessons": [
          {
            "title": "Lesson #1",
            "id": 145215,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Um sinal de <code>!</code> na frente de <code>true</code> faz com que a expressão resulte em <code>false</code>. Se o jogador não está vivo, ele está derrotado.</p><p>O sinal <code>!</code> é o <strong>operador de negação</strong>. Ele transforma valores em seu <strong>oposto</strong>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #2",
            "id": 145216,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Quando mudamos um valor para o seu oposto com <code>!</code>, nós o negamos.</p><p>Coloque um sinal de <code>!</code> antes de <code>true</code> para mudar seu valor.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!</code> seguido de <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 145217,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O operador <code>!</code> antes de <code>false</code> também altera seu valor. Se um nível não está bloqueado, ele tem que ser desbloqueado.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"13\" /><option startIndex=\"13\" endIndex=\"18\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"false\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!</code> seguido de <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #4",
            "id": 145218,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos usar o operador <code>!</code> com variáveis para negar os valores que elas armazenam.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"40\" endIndex=\"41\" /><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"54\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerIsAlive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!playerIsAlive);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!</code> seguido de <code>playerIsAlive</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #5",
            "id": 145219,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Podemos salvar uma negação inteira em outra variável também.</p><p>Crie a variável <code>playerIsDefeated</code> e use <code>!</code> para mudar <code>playerIsAlive</code> para <code>false</code>.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"34\" endIndex=\"50\" /><option startIndex=\"51\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"67\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerIsAlive = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" playerIsDefeated = !playerIsAlive;\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(playerIsDefeated);\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>playerIsDefeated</code> seguido de <code>=</code> e depois <code>!</code>, <code>playerIsAlive</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #6",
            "id": 145220,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>O que o operador <code>!</code> faz?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item correct=\"true\" value=\"1\">Ele transforma valores <code>true</code> ou <code>false</code> em seus opostos</item><item correct=\"false\" value=\"2\">Verifica se os valores são iguais</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Ele transforma valores <code>true</code> ou <code>false</code> em seus opostos.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #7",
            "id": 145221,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Por que este código exibe <code>false</code> no console?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" canRespawn = !\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(canRespawn);\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O operador <code>!</code> na frente de <code>true</code> transforma seu valor em false</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">As variáveis sempre aparecem como <code>false</code> no console</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O operador <code>!</code> na frente de <code>true</code> transforma seu valor em false.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #8",
            "id": 145222,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Como chamamos o sinal <code>!</code> na frente de <code>true</code> ou <code>false</code>?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">O sinal <code>!</code> é o operador de negação</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">O sinal <code>!</code> é o operador de adição</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">O sinal <code>!</code> é o operador de negação.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #9",
            "id": 145223,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Qual valor <code>result</code> armazena?</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" result = !\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>false</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>true</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>false</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #10",
            "id": 145224,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Use o operador de negação e armazene um valor na variável.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"26\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option startIndex=\"27\" endIndex=\"31\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" enemySpawnEnabled = !\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!</code> seguido de <code>true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #11",
            "id": 145225,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Exiba <code>false</code> no console.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"!false\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"17\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #12",
            "id": 145226,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Crie a variável e salve o valor negado nela.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"25\" endIndex=\"30\" /><option startIndex=\"31\" endIndex=\"43\" /><option startIndex=\"46\" endIndex=\"57\" /></options></interaction></interactions><content><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorIsOpen = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\";\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"const\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" doorIsClosed = !doorIsOpen;\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>const</code> seguido de <code>doorIsClosed</code> e finalmente <code>!doorIsOpen</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #13",
            "id": 145227,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Codifique <code>!true</code> dentro da instrução de exibição.</p><code name=\"script.js\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"javascript\"><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"17\" isDefault=\"true\" /></interactions><content><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(!\" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text value=\");}\" /></content></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Certifique-se de escolher <code>!true</code>.</p></body></html>"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
